---

<SiteLayout
  title="Longfei Han · 韩龙飞"
  description="韩龙飞 · 医学人工智能研究者 | 北京工商大学 MAGIC 实验室"
>
  <main class="home-layout">
    <aside class="profile-sidebar" data-reveal>
      <img
        class="profile-sidebar__avatar"
        src={profile.avatar.src}
        alt={`${profile.name.zh}的肖像`}
        width={profile.avatar.width}
        height={profile.avatar.height}
      />
      <h1 class="profile-sidebar__name">
        {profile.name.zh}
        <span class="profile-sidebar__name-en" lang="en">{profile.name.en}</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="profile-sidebar__role">{profile.role}</p>
      <p class="profile-sidebar__org">{profile.org}</p>

      <div class="profile-sidebar__block">
        <span class="profile-sidebar__title">联系方式</span>
        <ul class="profile-sidebar__contact">
          <li>
            <span>邮箱</span>
            <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>地址</span>
            <span>{profile.location} · 中国</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {profile.social.length > 0 && (
        <div class="profile-sidebar__block">
          <span class="profile-sidebar__title">学术链接</span>
          <div class="profile-sidebar__social">
            {profile.social.map((link) => (
              <a href={link.url} rel="noreferrer">
                <span class="profile-sidebar__social-label">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d={socialIcons[link.icon]} />
                  </svg>
                  <span>{link.label}</span>
                </span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      )}

      <div class="profile-sidebar__block">
        <span class="profile-sidebar__title">研究兴趣</span>
        <div class="interest-tags">
          {profile.interests.map((interest) => <span>{interest}</span>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="content-main">
      <section class="home-section" id="biography">
        <h2>个人简介</h2>
        <div class="bio-copy" data-reveal set:html={profile.bio} />
        <div class="bio-actions" data-reveal>
          <a class="button-v2 button-v2--primary" href="mailto:longfeihan@btbu.edu.cn">
            联系我 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="home-section" id="research">
        <h2>研究方向与应用</h2>
        <div class="direction-grid" data-reveal>
          {directions.map((direction) => (
            <article class="direction-card">
              <span>{direction.index}</span>
              <h3>{direction.title}</h3>
              <p>{direction.text}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="lab-note" data-reveal>
          欢迎有自驱力的硕士研究生与高年级本科生加入。请将研究兴趣与简历发送至
          <a href="mailto:longfeihan@btbu.edu.cn">longfeihan@btbu.edu.cn</a>。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="home-section" id="news">
        <h2>近期动态</h2>
        <ul class="news-list" data-reveal>
          {news.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <time>{item.date}</time>
              <span>{item.text}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="home-section" id="featured-publications">
        <h2>代表性论文</h2>
        <div class="pub-featured" data-reveal>
          {featured.map((pub) => (
            <article class="pub-card">
              <div class="pub-card__media">
                <img src={pubCover(pub)} alt={`${pub.title} 示意图`} loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="pub-card__body">
                <h3>
                  <a class="pub-card__title" href={`/publications/${pub.slug}/`}>
                    {pub.title}
                  </a>
                </h3>
                <p class="pub-card__venue">{pub.venue} · {pub.year}</p>
                <div class="pub-card__links">
                  {pub.code && (
                    <a href={pub.code} rel="noreferrer">
                      代码 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                    </a>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="pub-featured__more" data-reveal>
          <a href="/publications/">
            全部论文 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="home-section" id="recent-posts">
        <h2>近期写作</h2>
        {posts.length > 0 ? (
          <>
            <div class="post-list-v2" data-reveal>
              {posts.map((post) => (
                <a
                  class="post-row-v2 post-row-v2--link"
                  href={`/writing/${post.slug}/`}
                >
                  <time>{formatDate(post.data.publishedAt)}</time>
                  <span>{post.data.title}</span>
                  <span>
                    阅读 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="writing-v2__more">
              <a href="/writing/">
                全部博文 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </>
        ) : (
          <div class="writing-empty" data-reveal>
            <p class="writing-empty__kicker">归档迁移中</p>
            <h3>历史博文正在陆续迁移。</h3>
            <p>旧站博文将分批迁入本站，第一批文章很快就会与大家见面。</p>
          </div>
        )}
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
